+# upstream vLLM, not part of Xia et al.'s taxonomy). Fourth sibling --
+# crosses spec_casc_tok_semantic_guard_future_guard's trigger shape (gate the K
+# positions AFTER spec-casc-tok's own relaxed test accepts a hesitation/
+# discourse marker, not the marker itself) with
