+# never more lenient than plain future-guard's own window at any guarded
+# position (min(pi_rej_x, target_prob) <= target_prob always, with equality
+# only when pi_rej_x >= target_prob) -- see spec_casc_tok_semantic_guard_and's
+# own module comment (that patch, this repo) for why the override family
+# doesn't have this property and the AND family does.
