+# set, the cross-round persistent state, the "recovery stays plain pi_rej,
+# not further AND-adjusted" simplification -- is identical to plain
+# spec_casc_tok_semantic_guard_future_guard; see that patch (this repo) for the
+# full mechanism writeup. Only the in-window accept test differs.
